<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11934]  Bugs &amp; tests fixes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11934</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue contains fixes for several issues:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;AssertionError occurs on the client when coordinator killed (with ZK discovery)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteVersionUtils#BUILD_TSTAMP_DATE_FORMATTER is used in a non thread-safe manner.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Possible discovery race on node joining with Authenticator.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;PageLocksCommand#parseArguments cannot properly parse arguments user, password if its at the end of arguments list.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Test CheckpointFreeListTest.testRestoreFreeListCorrectlyAfterRandomStop failed on TC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteWalFlushBackgroundSelfTest.testFailWhileStart &amp;amp; IgniteWalFlushLogOnlySelfTest.testFailWhileStart fail in disk compression suite.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;IgniteClientConnectAfterCommunicationFailureTest fails&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Add scale factor for PageLockTrackerTests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
